Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.11,0:02:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我不该说这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shouldn't be telling you this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.36,0:02:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 说嘛 - 那是个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Go on. Go on. - You have to understand...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.65,0:02:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,很混淆 黑暗的时代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}these were dark and confusing times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.15,0:02:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,国与国之间非常动乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An enormous amount of turmoil between countries.{\r}
