Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.29,0:02:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,最强的武器就是他们脑袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whose greatest weapons were their minds.{\r}
