Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.16,0:03:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,间谍唯一怕的就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only things spies were truly afraid of...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.63,0:03:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,别的间谍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}were other spies...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.00,0:03:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,敌国的间谍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}enemy spies.{\r}
