Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.88,0:04:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,她了解到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it made her realize...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.38,0:04:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,多年不带感情的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how years of working with detached emotion...{\r}
