Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.94,0:04:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,他们决定一起面对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they decided that,together they would embark...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.90,0:04:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,此生最艰难的任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the most dangerous mission of all time.{\r}
