Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.24,0:13:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,说的对 卡门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're so right,Carmen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.12,0:13:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,克兹家人有什么了不起？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's so special about being a Cortez?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.58,0:13:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,真希望能到你的世界 怪脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish I could go away to your world,Floop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.83,0:13:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你就能当我朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd be my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.76,0:13:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thank you all...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.26,0:13:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,参加今天的展示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for attending today's demonstration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.64,0:13:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们每年付庞大资金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Year after year we pay outrageous sums of money to several inventors{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.65,0:13:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,给几位发明家改进科技\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to come up with our technologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.23,0:13:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,暗黑破坏王是梦想家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Floop is one such visionary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.48,0:13:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他的脑筋有点问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However,his inventions are somewhat questionable...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.28,0:13:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,需要在评估\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and,therefore,need to be evaluated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.32,0:13:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你答应给我一支军团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You promised us an army,Mr. Floop...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.45,0:13:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,但花了十亿只得到这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but our first billion dollars bought us only this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.20,0:13:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,变种的间谍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}mutated secret agents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.62,0:13:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,变异和洗脑过程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mutative process and brain wipe...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.58,0:13:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,造成他们心智混乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}caused their minds to turn to mush.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.63,0:14:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,除了在我节目上表演 几乎没什么用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have found little use for them except as novelties on my...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.97,0:14:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,第二名机器人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}well,my children's show,currently rated number two?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.14,0:14:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,第二名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Number two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.30,0:14:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这些手指人是什么玩意？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the devil are these finger men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.68,0:14:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他们叫"大姆哥"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. They're called Thumb-thumbs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.14,0:14:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,很厉害的机器人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very capable robots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.02,0:14:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,废物!真没用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All thumbs. Useless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.07,0:14:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这个你会喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Lisp,I think you'll enjoy this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.36,0:14:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,门后面将出现一个 非常强悍的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Through that door,an awesome power will emerge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.99,0:14:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须瞬间解决他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will have but a moment to disarm it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.66,0:14:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,要在10秒之内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In exactly ten seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.50,0:14:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,7…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seven...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.84,0:14:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,5…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.05,0:14:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,3…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.77,0:14:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,强尼？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Johnny?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.69,0:15:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你犹豫了 - 当然犹豫 他是我儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You hesitated. - I had to. He's my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.91,0:15:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.12,0:15:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我设计的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually,I designed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.37,0:15:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我创造了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I built him !{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.54,0:15:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他叫…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.87,0:15:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,X-52495 二号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}X-5-2-4-9-5,the second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.50,0:15:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你的伟大发明？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is your big idea?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.71,0:15:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,像我孩子的机器娃娃？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Robot kids that look like my children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.05,0:15:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,总统的女儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The president's daughter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.26,0:15:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,一模一样的复制品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An almost-exact replica.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.52,0:15:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,有时要想出伟大计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes in order to think big...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.39,0:15:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,得"从小"做起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you have to think small.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.86,0:15:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,运用物理电机塑像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Through physio-electrical imaging...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.02,0:15:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我能复制出任何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can make them look like anyone...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.53,0:15:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,全球最厉害的间谍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}yet the cunning and intelligence...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.90,0:15:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,其智慧都装置在这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the world's greatest espionage agents...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.28,0:15:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,源源不断的小人里 我叫他们"间谍小子"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all rolled into tiny packages I call "Spy Kids."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.91,0:15:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,"间谍小子"以你广博的知识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me,Spy Kids with your vast stores of knowledge...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.92,0:16:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我 人类说谎时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what are four of the five physiological indications...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.17,0:16:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,会有哪些生理反应？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that a human being is lying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.97,0:16:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,还没完全做好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not quite finished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.30,0:16:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,少一个最重要的零件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Missing one crucial element.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.18,0:16:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,少什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Missing what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.72,0:16:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的头脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their brains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.73,0:16:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这堆废铁哪可能像真小孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These buckets of bolts will never pass as children !{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.31,0:16:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要赶进度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a schedule to keep,Floop...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.98,0:16:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,机会是不等人的 要快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a window of opportunity that's closing fast!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.36,0:16:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,两天后我会来接收军团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will be back in two days to pick up our army...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.07,0:16:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,否则就拿走一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or we'll take whatever you do have,cut our losses...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.33,0:16:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,免得再让你这蠢发明浪费钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and lay your entire silly empire to waste!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.45,0:16:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我没时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.04,0:16:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,小鬼们送李先生去他的直升机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Escort Mr. Lisp back to his chopper,children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.97,0:16:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 很棒的发明 - 谢谢你 迷你安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That was brilliant,sir. - Thank you,Minion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.64,0:16:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我得想办法完成他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now all I have to do is make them work for real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.10,0:17:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你去哪？- 出任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're going where? - On assignment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.48,0:17:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,几位"欧斯"成员失踪？包括唐纳根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Several OSS agents are missing,including Donnagon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.98,0:17:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,没人要求赎金 就这样失踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No ransom,no demands. They just disappeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.82,0:17:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你退休了九年 现在又答应接任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After nine years,you are accepting an assignment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.78,0:17:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为什么？- 因为戴福林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why? - In a word,Devlin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.62,0:17:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他亲自打给你？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Devlin himself called?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.00,0:17:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,对 要我出任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He called,asked me to go in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.21,0:17:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.54,0:17:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,英格丽 你一直想再接任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ingrid,you're always looking to go on another mission...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.13,0:17:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们有孩子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we have children now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.47,0:17:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不能两个都离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't both leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.63,0:17:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我想去冒险 - 拯救全世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I want to go on an adventure. - I want to save the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.51,0:17:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,还想啊？甜心 还玩不腻？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Again? Honey,it's old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.51,0:17:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,要不是他们失踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it wasn't for Donnagon and the other agents...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.02,0:17:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我都想回绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would be turning this mission down myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.89,0:17:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,甜心 真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean,clearly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.65,0:17:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你要让我失望？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna turn me down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.40,0:17:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.03,0:17:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,间谍宝贝…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spy boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.41,0:17:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,英格丽…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ingrid,Ingrid...Ingrid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.95,0:18:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What...what about the children?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.04,0:18:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 菲利克斯伯伯 - 菲利克斯伯伯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Uncle Felix! - Uncle Felix!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.41,0:18:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,小可爱 你们好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,churros,how are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.54,0:18:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,上次来你这么高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last time I saw you,you were this big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.54,0:18:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,缩水啦？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're shrinking. What's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.21,0:18:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我拿包包\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here,take this bag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.30,0:18:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你赶来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for coming on short notice,guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.30,0:18:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,一家人嘛 人家都这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what families are for. That's what I hear,anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.27,0:18:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我认识你吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I know you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.41,0:18:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好像又… - 回到从前？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Feels,uh... - Like old times?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.37,0:18:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.62,0:18:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,S414往圣西西里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}S-4-1-4 to Santa Cecilia on assignment to Bond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.75,0:18:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,任务:寻找失踪欧斯干员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Missing OSS operatives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.05,0:18:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,英格丽和格瑞利干员已上路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agents Ingrid and Gregorio Cortez en route.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.59,0:18:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,真高兴又听见这名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,it's good to hear those names again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.30,0:18:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 晚安 葛小姐 - 你好 格瑞利…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good evening,Ms. Gradenko. - Hello,Greg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.56,0:19:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,还有克兹太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Mrs. Cortez.{\r}
