Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.96,0:27:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,卡门·克兹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carmen Cortez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.30,0:27:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,请说全名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your full name,please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.63,0:27:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我不用全名 太长了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't use my full name. It's too long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.34,0:27:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,请说全名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your full name,please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.76,0:28:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,卡门·伊丽莎白·安妮塔科斯塔·克兹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carmen Elizabeth Juanita Costa-Brava Cortez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.31,0:28:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我的名字是密码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name's a pass-code?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.66,0:28:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这地方太奇妙了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This place is amazing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.46,0:28:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,空的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Empty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.17,0:28:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,没东西吃怎么能叫"避难屋"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How safe is a safe house if there's nothing to eat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.18,0:28:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,喷射背包\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Machete's Buddy Pack"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.32,0:28:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,急用现金？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emergency cash?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.20,0:28:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,各国都有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From every country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.99,0:29:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,全都拿了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I'd better take all of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.72,0:29:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,吃吃看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.05,0:29:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,说 谢谢卡门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you,Carmen !{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.73,0:29:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会再见面的 他们说过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll see them again. Just like they said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.90,0:29:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这次要相信他们的话吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So this time we're supposed to believe them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.91,0:29:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不用担心这些小家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's stop worrying about the children.{\r}
