Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.79,0:29:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,只有一个晚上包\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only one is in diapers and only at night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.41,0:29:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,别大惊小怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not that unusual,OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.62,0:29:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我不愿意出任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is why I never wanted to go on another mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.29,0:29:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你怪我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you blaming me for this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.92,0:29:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才你还很高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An hour ago you seemed happy to be back in the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.55,0:30:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才我还不是俘虏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An hour ago I was not a prisoner of war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.68,0:30:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只是有点生疏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK,we're a little rusty,that's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.55,0:30:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,只有这样能找出主使者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is one way to find out who's behind all this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.93,0:30:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,要好好运用压力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I can just get the pressure right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.90,0:30:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好在还没忘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's still got it.{\r}
