Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.90,0:30:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,hey,hey,what about me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.74,0:30:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,以前我们很远就嗅出危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember when we could sense danger a mile away?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.09,0:30:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 美好往事 - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Those were the days. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.38,0:30:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.93,0:30:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,甜心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aah ! Sweetheart!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.02,0:30:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,了不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.20,0:31:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK,OK,come on,come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.82,0:31:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right. - Yeah,yeah,fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.83,0:31:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,真了不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very clever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.00,0:31:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,虚拟实境房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Virtual room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.50,0:31:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.81,0:31:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这是哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.91,0:31:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,想像力丰富 值得加分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta give him points for imagination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.22,0:32:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你们花了15分钟才逃脱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fifteen minutes to escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.64,0:32:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,以两位的名声我以为会有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With your reputations I was expecting something...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.89,0:32:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,更好的表现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a little more impressive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.06,0:32:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,终于可以吃饭了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finally,we can eat!{\r}
