Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.59,0:32:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,大姆哥就会来弹你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and my fingers snap you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.43,0:32:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你把欧斯干员藏哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are the OSS agents you've taken?{\r}
