Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.61,0:33:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,想创造一个综合智慧库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}attempting to create a synthetic intelligence...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.49,0:33:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,间谍知识大全的产物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a compendium of spy knowledge,if you will.{\r}
