Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.79,0:33:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这小组中有个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was someone else on that research team,hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.51,0:33:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,可以再造那个产物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone else who could rebuild it.{\r}
