Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.49,0:33:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,他会成为假期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think he's gonna be a best-seller.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.45,0:33:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,最抢手的玩具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And just in time for the holiday rush.{\r}
