Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.37,0:34:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好间谍要懂得用脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"A good spy uses his head." Got that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.83,0:34:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,书上第一条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the first one in the book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.42,0:34:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好恶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ew,gross!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.71,0:34:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你看到什么？- 你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you see? - You.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.88,0:34:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不好笑 眼睛靠近一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very funny. Focus your eyes closer...{\r}
