Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.39,0:34:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是电脑荧幕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the computer screen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.56,0:35:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,像资料库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a database of some kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.73,0:35:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,妈说的那故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The wedding from the story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.94,0:35:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是他们自己的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was theirs.{\r}
