Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.42,0:35:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,有钥匙吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh,Carmen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.30,0:35:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我没钥匙 去找东西撬开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have a key. Go knock it against something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.92,0:35:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,"好间谍什么都不怕"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"A good spy has no fear."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.89,0:35:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,朱尼 你当不了好间谍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry,Juni. Guess you can't be a spy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.35,0:35:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好间谍会从敌人角度…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"A good spy puts himself..." herself...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.27,0:35:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,思考问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"in the mind-set of the opponent."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.27,0:35:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,思考\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mind-set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.11,0:35:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就这样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's exactly what we'll do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.78,0:35:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,只有靠我们了 你行吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's up to us. You with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.49,0:36:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 行什么？- 去找欧斯干员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- With you what? - Find the OSS like Felix said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.29,0:36:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 那我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- OK. - Then let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.92,0:36:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我姓葛 是你父母同事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi! I'm Ms. Gradenko. We work for your parents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.68,0:36:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"We?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.93,0:36:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你们很怀疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can understand if you don't trust me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.97,0:36:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,上次见面 你还是婴儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were a baby when we first met.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.52,0:36:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,记得我了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember me now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.52,0:36:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 看 我有钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry. I have a key. You see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.27,0:36:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是来保护你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're all on the same side. We're here to protect you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.02,0:36:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我妈也有这手镯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mom has a bracelet like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.32,0:36:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,欧斯干员标志 我们都有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OSS standard issue. We all have one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.24,0:36:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,欧斯？你是他们同事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OSS? You work with my parents?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.32,0:36:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,对 仔细听好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Now,please listen closely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.53,0:36:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,张开耳朵听好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open your ears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.49,0:36:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你爸今天早上发给我们一个讯号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You father was able to send one last communique this morning...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.54,0:36:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,就在他失踪前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before he disappeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.08,0:36:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,有五个字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It consisted of five letters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.67,0:36:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,暗黑破坏王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}F-I-O-O-P!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.35,0:37:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.89,0:37:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,伟大的破坏王不会那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fabulous Floop would never do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.47,0:37:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 他没那么伟大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,trust me. He's not that fabulous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.81,0:37:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,而且 认识他们吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact,recognize these?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.36,0:37:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他的怪脸们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Floop's Fooglies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.11,0:37:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我有他们玩具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got toy versions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.98,0:37:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,被转换前 他们是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is what they looked like before he mutated them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.70,0:37:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他们把间谍变成怪物？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean these mutants are captured secret agents?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.53,0:37:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那人是天才 - 我说过破坏王很厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're dealing with a genius. - Told you Floop was a freak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.37,0:37:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那些怪脸唱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that cute,little tuneless song...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.54,0:37:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,可爱的歌 倒回去听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the characters sing? Play it backwards...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.08,0:37:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,破坏王疯了 快来救我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're trapped! Floop is a madman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.87,0:37:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,救命 救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help us! Save us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.13,0:37:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,破坏王疯了 快来救我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Floop is a madman! Help us! Save us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.04,0:37:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在求救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A cry for help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.71,0:37:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,爸妈也会变那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will Floop do that to Mom and Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.17,0:37:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Definitely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.17,0:37:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,除非得到你爸研究的一个东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless he gets something your father helped develop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.10,0:37:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你记不记得他提过一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there's anything you can possibly remember...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.39,0:37:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 第三脑？- 什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The Third Brain lives. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.06,0:37:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,菲利克斯叫我告诉欧斯一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Felix gave us a message to deliver to the OSS...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.56,0:37:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你就来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and here you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.40,0:37:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我来了 什么事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here I am. What's the message?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.23,0:37:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,第三脑还在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Third Brain lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.74,0:38:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,卡门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ohh ! Carmen...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.41,0:38:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我宣布你正式成为 欧斯女间谍一员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you have just joined the ranks of women spies in the OSS.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.41,0:38:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brilliant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.20,0:38:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 臭女生 - 现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Girls. - Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.42,0:38:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,第三脑在哪里呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where does the Third Brain live exactly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.75,0:38:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,菲利克斯有告诉你吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did Felix tell you that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.92,0:38:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,好像他没说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think he said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.84,0:38:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他没说？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.26,0:38:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.26,0:38:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,搜!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Search the place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.43,0:38:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不在他家一定在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't at the house,so it must be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.10,0:38:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你去过我家？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were at our house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.27,0:38:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,糟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.27,0:38:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.86,0:38:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,它真的存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It exists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.28,0:38:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,暗黑破坏王就是要这个？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what Floop wants?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.54,0:38:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,它真美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's so beautiful!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.75,0:38:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,她是破坏王手下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carmen ! She's working for Floop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.25,0:38:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,穿上它飞到暗黑城堡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fly this to Floop's castle immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.96,0:39:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好的 妈妈 - 别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes,ma'am. - Don't move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.80,0:39:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本不会用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't even know what those things are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.64,0:39:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道它很重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know they've heavy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.85,0:39:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这装置要花一百万\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,they cost millions of dollars!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.23,0:39:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,有这东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That brain's the only thing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.48,0:39:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,爸妈就不会有事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}keeping Mom and Dad from being zapped !{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.53,0:39:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,拦住她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.38,0:39:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,叫大姆哥进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send in the thumbs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.68,0:39:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,等等我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait for me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.47,0:39:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这玩意怎么弄？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unh ! How do you work this thing?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.60,0:39:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,把她抓回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring her back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.82,0:40:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不想见爸妈吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah,ah,ah ! Don't you want to see your parents...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.69,0:40:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,小捣蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you little brat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.07,0:40:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 呃 - 哦 抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Unh ! - Whoops! Sorry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.37,0:40:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,别抓我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.88,0:40:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你们怎么搞的？孩子都抓不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong with you? They're just children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.44,0:40:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,头发完蛋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bad hair day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.92,0:41:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,哦哦 起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh-oh. Going up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.69,0:41:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.77,0:41:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你去哪了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.77,0:41:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,就在他后面 你呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm right behind him ! Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.15,0:41:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我很惨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm toast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.40,0:41:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,第三脑还我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me back that brain !{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.28,0:41:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,离我远点 大坏蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get away from me! Tough guy,huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.49,0:41:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See ya !{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.30,0:41:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,my sister!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.47,0:41:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,喔 老弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,brother!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.85,0:41:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我撑不住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't hold on much longer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.43,0:42:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,抓紧 笨小孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get a grip,you big baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.27,0:42:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我往下滑 - 撑住 小肥手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm slipping ! - Hang on,butterfingers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.40,0:42:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我快不行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not gonna make it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.19,0:42:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,就快到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're almost there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.07,0:42:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别把我丢下 - 我不会丢下你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't drop me! - I'm not gonna drop you !{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.21,0:42:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,没有我你就完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would you do without me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.69,0:43:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这是残酷的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a cruel,cruel world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.36,0:43:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,小朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All you little boys and girls{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.11,0:43:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,有些坏蛋想吃掉你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And some mean nasty people.Want to have you for their supper{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.91,0:43:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我来 你们就会自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you follow me you can all be free{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.24,0:43:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,自由 像鸟一样自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Free,you can all be free{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.37,0:43:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,只要守着电视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As a bird on a big TV{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.83,0:43:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你有梦 有梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you dream,if you dream{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.67,0:43:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你有梦 有梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you dream my dream{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.75,0:43:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一个残酷的世界充满了讨厌的男生和女生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a cruel,cruel world full of nasty boys and girls{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.75,0:43:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,充满自私 意思是 讨厌的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Full of selfish,mean,nasty people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.51,0:43:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,讨厌 讨厌 讨厌 讨厌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nasty,nasty,nasty,nasty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.05,0:43:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,有个方法能让自己快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there's a way you can make your day{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.97,0:43:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以笑 可以来找我玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can laugh,you can smile,you can come and stay awhile{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.18,0:44:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我一起玩 一起做梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can dream my dream,you can have it all with me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.39,0:44:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你我一起作梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can dream my dream,you can dream my dream{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.65,0:44:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你我一起作梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can dream my dream{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.58,0:44:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.21,0:44:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,把他们关起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lock them up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.64,0:44:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,还需要什么 迷你安？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does it need,Minion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.60,0:44:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不… - 我的节目需要别的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't... - My show! It needs something !{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.35,0:44:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,才能变成最棒的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That thing that will take it to number one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.44,0:44:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉得到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can feel it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.77,0:44:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,但想不出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I can think straight enough to figure it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.02,0:44:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你花太多时间想节目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Floop,you're spending too much time on this program.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.19,0:44:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,应该多想想大计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should be more concerned with our grand diabolical plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.03,0:44:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 企业化？- 机器娃娃军团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Syndication? - The army of robot children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.12,0:45:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这机器人让我绞尽脑汁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This hardware gets in the way of my creative abilities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.58,0:45:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你没抓到孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lost the children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.33,0:45:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他们逃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not only did they escape...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.88,0:45:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,还带走"第三脑"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they took the Third Brain with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.59,0:45:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,真的存在？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It exists?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.92,0:45:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,真的 格瑞利骗我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Completely. Cortez lied to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.47,0:45:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,派最棒的大姆哥去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send our best Thumbs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.72,0:45:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,要抓犯人就派犯人去抓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir,if you want to catch a criminal you send a criminal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.47,0:45:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,要抓间谍就派…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you want to snare a spy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.56,0:45:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,快点说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please speak English,Minion !{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.77,0:45:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这灯光热死我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been baking under those studio lights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.10,0:45:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 要抓小孩 - 嗯哼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- If you want to find a child... - Mm-hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.81,0:45:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,就该派小孩去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send a child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.53,0:45:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,很聪明 迷你安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is brilliant,Minion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.82,0:45:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.90,0:46:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,什么定位器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some locating device.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.94,0:46:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,座标在指什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't even figure out where the coordinates point to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.61,0:46:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,谁做的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who makes this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.90,0:46:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,马雀公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Machete Products."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.80,0:46:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.22,0:46:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,在找爸妈全靠它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's our bargaining chip on getting Mom and Dad back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.14,0:46:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,破坏王要的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is what Floop wants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.81,0:46:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,爸妈一定希望毁掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think Mom and Dad would want this destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.60,0:46:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道他们想要什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know what they want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.89,0:46:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,连他们是间谍我们都不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until this morning,you didn't even know who they were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.27,0:46:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,先把第三脑留著\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We keep the brain.For now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.11,0:46:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛还带著它？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you still wearing that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.11,0:47:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,搞不好是追踪器 他们可能追踪我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That could be a tracer. They could be tracking us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.61,0:47:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,少用你的手指指我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't start pointing fingers at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.91,0:47:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我可没干蠢事 蠢蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't do anything stupid,stupid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.87,0:47:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,别叫我蠢蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better stop calling me names.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.12,0:47:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不然呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.79,0:47:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不然我也叫你蠢蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or I'm gonna call you names.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.79,0:47:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,座标在右边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The booger was right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.96,0:47:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,真讨厌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.39,0:47:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不是叫你别缠我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thought I ditched you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.64,0:47:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你穿这是什么衣服？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you dressed like a geek?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.94,0:47:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是你姐了 走开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're no longer relatives. Go away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.73,0:47:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,才说你蠢 你就更蠢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're just getting stupider by the minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.15,0:47:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get away from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.82,0:47:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,放我下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Put me down !{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.16,0:47:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我早就想扁他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always wanted to do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.71,0:47:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你很厉害喔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ohh ! Tough guy,huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.46,0:47:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Juni!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.13,0:48:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,放我下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put me down !{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.76,0:48:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,把第三脑毁掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Destroy the brain !{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.22,0:48:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,摧毁它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Destroy it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.30,0:49:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,第三脑被抢了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They took the brain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.42,0:49:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我拿了她项炼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,but I took her necklace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.64,0:49:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她没注意 - 他们不聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She didn't even notice. - They weren't very smart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.22,0:49:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,连话都不会说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yours couldn't even speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.06,0:49:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,"间谍小子限量版"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Limited edition. Spy Kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.39,0:49:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,"500之1"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"One of five hundred..."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.56,0:49:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,破坏王做了几百个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Floop could have hundreds of these flying around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.52,0:49:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,第三脑能让他们变聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Third Brain makes them smart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.40,0:49:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,就成了一支军团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're building an army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.07,0:49:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要救爸妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got to save Mom and Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.70,0:49:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,只有他们能阻止机器人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only they can stop the robots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.91,0:49:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那谁来救我们？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But who's gonna help us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.49,0:49:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们完成了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had it working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.12,0:50:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,综合智慧仪非常聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A synthetic intelligence as smart as any spy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.46,0:50:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,把那脑子锁紧吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you go ahead and tighten that brain up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.46,0:50:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,第三脑系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Third Brain System.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.30,0:50:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,欧斯长官知道 若敌方取得这个技术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The OSS Director realized it was too dangerous...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.31,0:50:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,会造成极大危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if the wrong forces found the technology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.23,0:50:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们奉命摧毁它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were ordered to destroy it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.48,0:50:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,已毁掉了 干嘛还瞒著我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why keep that a secret from me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.90,0:50:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,为了保护我们？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To protect us from something you destroyed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.82,0:50:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,还是你没毁掉？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or something you didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.04,0:50:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这么多秘密 瞒著你 瞒著孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All these secrets from me,from the children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.09,0:50:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不能再这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has to stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.88,0:50:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.01,0:50:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,他要第三脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants the Brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.76,0:50:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,如果要救孩子 全世界就会危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we save our children,we risk the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.43,0:50:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那会成了什么世界？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what in the world do we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.98,0:51:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你开这么远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for taking us this far,but...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.44,0:51:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我只有这些钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this is all we got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.11,0:51:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,来这里干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.32,0:51:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,爸的代号一定是"红贝"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad's code name must be Hombre.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.03,0:51:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那这个就是"马雀"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So,this must be Machete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.20,0:51:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要找爸的伴郎帮忙？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're getting help from Dad's best man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.30,0:51:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you working on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.47,0:51:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,做世上最小的摄影机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}World's smallest camera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.22,0:51:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,看不见啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.60,0:51:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,它看见你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah,but it sees you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.19,0:51:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你卖反间谍物品吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sell counterintelligence stuff here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.02,0:51:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 找你爸妈去 - 不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come back with your parents. - We can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.28,0:51:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要最快的飞机去这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need something fast that can get us here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.28,0:51:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.82,0:51:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,卡门·伊丽莎白·安妮塔科斯塔·克兹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carmen Elizabeth Juanita Costa-Brava Cortez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.91,0:52:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,格瑞利是我爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gregorio Cortez is our father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.87,0:52:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你去了他的婚礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were at his wedding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.17,0:52:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,转过身去 离开我的店\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will turn around. You will leave my shop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.84,0:52:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想再听到我弟名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I never want to hear my brother's name again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.97,0:52:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我们伯伯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're our uncle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.64,0:52:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,真的伯伯吗？之前有个是假的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our real uncle? 'Cause we already got a fake uncle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.56,0:52:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,格瑞利是我最小的弟弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gregorio Cortez is my younger brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.61,0:52:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,总统的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}President's daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.15,0:52:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,总统的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}President's son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.36,0:52:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.66,0:52:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,首相的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prime Minister's son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.74,0:52:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,将军的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General's daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.29,0:52:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,全按照计划 都在这了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're all here as planned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.96,0:52:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我要回去弄我的节目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to get back to my show now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.13,0:52:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你该先解决眼前的任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must focus on the task at hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.80,0:52:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,李先生快来接收军团了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to prepare the army before Mr. Lisp arrives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.30,0:52:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想弄这个了 迷你安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe in this anymore,Minion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.80,0:52:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我本来就不想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think I ever did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.80,0:53:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,请解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Explain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.10,0:53:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,变种间谍 机器人不是我的点子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mutated agents,the robot kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.98,0:53:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,是你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those aren't my ideas. They're yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.19,0:53:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,所以呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.56,0:53:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我完成不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think that's why they're not working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.86,0:53:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,是还没完成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not yet they're not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.65,0:53:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,但现在我有第三脑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But,you see...I now have the Third Brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.28,0:53:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不需要你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need you anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.41,0:53:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,迷你安？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Minion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.96,0:53:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在要开始叫我迷先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I assure you,it's Mr. Minion now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.54,0:53:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经被利用完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you,Floop,have served your purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.17,0:53:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,间谍小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Children...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.97,0:53:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,把他关到"虚拟实境房"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lock him in the...virtual room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.72,0:53:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你是间谍吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a secret agent,aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.23,0:53:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你那里听来的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What makes you say that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.89,0:53:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,资料库显示你居无定所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}According to the database,you're always traveling...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.23,0:53:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,没人知道你的职业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and no one knows what you do for a living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.94,0:53:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,大家的伯伯都这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we all have uncles like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.78,0:53:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,又一个马雀的精品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Another fine Machete product."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.90,0:54:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你制造全球最棒的间谍用品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You make the best spy inventions in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.41,0:54:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's correct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.79,0:54:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,但好人坏人你都卖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you sell them to both sides,good and bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.50,0:54:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,所以爸爸不再跟你来往\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why Dad hasn't spoken of you in all these years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.42,0:54:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你也卖东西给暗黑破坏王吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever sell stuff to Floop?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.13,0:54:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,问这干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.30,0:54:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸妈…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our Mom and Dad...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.42,0:54:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你弟弟 被他抓了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your brother... are his prisoners...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.47,0:54:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不快想办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and if we don't do something to help...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.47,0:54:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,爸妈就完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}something really bad's gonna happen to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.60,0:54:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我不懂你为什么不救他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't see why you won't help him !{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.06,0:54:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我干嘛像褓母一样照顾他一辈子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think I want to baby-sit my brother the rest of my life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.89,0:54:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,小心格瑞利 照顾格瑞利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Watch out for Gregorio. Take care of Gregorio.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.89,0:54:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,要教格瑞利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Make sure Gregorio knows right from wrong."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.90,0:54:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,马雀只要对自己负责就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Machete's not responsible for nobody but Machete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.82,0:54:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,一家人不该这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that's not what family is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.78,0:54:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只是兄弟 圣经里兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're just brothers. Cain and Abel were brothers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.45,0:54:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,还自相残杀呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look how they ended up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.24,0:54:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,能最快让你们到暗黑城堡的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now,the only thing that will get you to Floop's castle fast enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.08,0:54:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,只有这个东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.38,0:54:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's tiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.84,0:54:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这只设计给一个人坐的 很快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's built for one passenger,but it's fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.55,0:54:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你要去吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.38,0:55:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.63,0:55:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为你弟弟？- 不去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- For your brother? - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.55,0:55:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,为我们呢？你的侄儿侄女？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then how about for us... your niece and nephew?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.77,0:55:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.44,0:55:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那么… - 不 不去 一百万次不去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How about if... - No! No! A million times no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.28,0:55:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,把猪肠递过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pass the pig intestines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.37,0:55:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我不吃那个了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not eating that now. Nope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.45,0:55:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我能不能… - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can I have a... - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.75,0:55:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,要一杯水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Glass of water?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.46,0:55:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢留宿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for letting us stay here...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.79,0:55:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我很担心爸妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while we ponder our parents' terrible fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.21,0:55:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,若不姓克兹 我才不留你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you weren't a Cortez,I wouldn't be doing this much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.92,0:55:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,亲情还是比金钱重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So family does mean more to you than money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.89,0:55:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.18,0:55:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸很想你喔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad misses you,too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.78,0:56:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.99,0:56:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.74,0:56:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we're talkin'.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.33,0:56:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.63,0:56:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,找去暗黑城堡的地图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Getting the map to Floop's castle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.30,0:56:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那是反射动作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shh. It's just a reflex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.13,0:56:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,看 他还在睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look. He's still asleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.56,0:56:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,别叫大人去做孩子的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never send an adult to do a kid's job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.74,0:56:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,帅啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.25,0:56:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,要我帮什么忙？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What can I do to help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.62,0:56:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,记得屋顶上的飞机吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember that spy plane up on the roof?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.29,0:56:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.25,0:57:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,看操作手册\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Start reading.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.42,0:57:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,做功课\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Homework.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.77,0:57:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.10,0:57:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,快 他来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry up! He's coming ! He's coming !{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.53,0:57:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,再见 马雀大伯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good-bye,Uncle Machete!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.40,0:57:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢借我们飞机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for the plane!{\r}
