Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.87,1:05:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,所有机器人请到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All robots please report...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.95,1:05:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,4 5 6号舱 准备进行装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to docking bays four,five,and six for immediate loading.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.00,1:05:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这个是通风口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the ventilator shaft here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.50,1:05:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,对 地牢在另一边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the dungeon's on the other side of the castle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.67,1:05:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,怎样能不被侦测到？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do we get there undetected?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.44,1:06:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他们比上次聪明了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think they've gotten smarter since the last time we met.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.44,1:06:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,有侵入者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Intruder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.91,1:06:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你行吗？- 应该可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you make it? - I think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.50,1:06:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Come on !{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.96,1:06:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 卡门 - 去找爸妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Carmen ! - Find Mom and Dad !{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.22,1:06:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,希望这里可以到关爸妈的地牢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope this leads to the dungeon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.03,1:06:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.28,1:06:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你手上是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that on your hands?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.78,1:06:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,是疹子 对嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warts,aren't they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.20,1:06:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这下好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.75,1:06:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,手出汗就会长疹子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From sweaty hands sprout warts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.87,1:07:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么手会出汗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know why you have sweaty hands?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.88,1:07:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,因为常常害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From being scared all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.38,1:07:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我不觉得你害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't look very scared to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.88,1:07:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我很生气 你抓走我爸妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's because I'm mad. You kidnapped my parents...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.47,1:07:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,制造机器坏小孩 还吞了我姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}made psycho robot children,and swallowed up my sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.60,1:07:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是我计划的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I didn't want any of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.44,1:07:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我以为暗黑破坏王是天才 - 真的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I thought Floop was a genius. - You did?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.82,1:07:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你有看我的节目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You watch my show?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.07,1:07:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你才知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More than you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.66,1:07:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,迷你安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alexander Minion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.04,1:07:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,克兹干员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agent Cortez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.25,1:07:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,真高兴再见面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wonderful to see you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.25,1:07:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你认识他？- 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know him? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.04,1:07:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他参与第三脑计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was on the Third Brain Project...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.05,1:07:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他被我发现 他想把自己的想法放进系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until I noticed he was trying to inject his own ideas into the system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.34,1:07:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我举发他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I turned him in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.10,1:07:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他就被赶出欧斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was thrown out of the OSS.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.68,1:08:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我虽不像破坏王那么天才\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid I'm not nearly the artist Floop is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.85,1:08:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,但别担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But not to worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.52,1:08:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我想到一个不错的主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have something else in mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.94,1:08:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你这样有什么好处？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think you're going to accomplish by doing this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.65,1:08:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,克兹太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,you see,Mrs. Cortez...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.41,1:08:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直是个有逻辑 目标确立\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've always been methodical,goal oriented.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.83,1:08:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,神经质的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Psychotically so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.29,1:08:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我不怕你 迷你安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not afraid of you,Alex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.83,1:08:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我想每个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I think it's refreshing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.96,1:08:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,都应该偶尔做点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to every once in a while...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.79,1:08:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好玩的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have some fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.34,1:08:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心你的小孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,and don't worry about your little brats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.92,1:08:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他们每天早上七点半到八点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll still be able to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.01,1:08:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,都能在电视上看到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every weekday morning between 7:30 and 8:00.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.79,1:09:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,暗黑破坏王大功告成了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I trust this time Floop will have a success to show us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.17,1:09:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,伟大的破坏王去外地洽公\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Fabulous Floop is away on other business,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.80,1:09:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,军团已完成了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your army is complete.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.64,1:09:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,终极战士正等候指挥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ultimate destructive force is now within your grasp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.68,1:09:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,等我看到 我才能相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll believe that when I see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.81,1:09:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎归队 葛小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome back,Ms. Gradenko.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.32,1:09:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,回来真好 迷你安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's good to be back,Alex.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.15,1:09:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,永远不要生小孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's never have children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.11,1:09:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 迷你安才是幕后恶魔 - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So Minion is the evil one. - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.95,1:09:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,对 但我也有错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I will be blamed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.95,1:09:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你绝对有理由怪罪我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have every reason to be disappointed in me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.00,1:09:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,关掉它后 你会做什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what would you do if you could shut this thing off and get out of here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.50,1:09:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能 只能从外面关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's impossible. It can only be turned off from the outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.76,1:09:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,假设嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just suppose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.97,1:09:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我会去阻止迷你安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd stop Minion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.55,1:09:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,阻止机器娃娃军团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd stop the robot army and hope...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.89,1:10:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好让世界原谅我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the world would forgive me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.35,1:10:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,暗黑破坏王 你是我的英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're my hero,Floop...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.85,1:10:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我帮你 你也要帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I'm gonna help you,then you're gonna help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.60,1:10:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一定要阻止迷你安 - 还有一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Minion must be stopped. - Just one thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.03,1:10:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我的节目 还需要什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My show...what does it need?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.78,1:10:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道它很需要一个东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know it needs something desperately...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.24,1:10:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,但想不出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I can't figure it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.45,1:10:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你想得到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you can?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.24,1:10:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,需要小孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It needs children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.58,1:10:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,抓稳了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.76,1:10:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去阻止迷你安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now let's stop Minion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.14,1:10:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,要阻止他 一定要阻止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must be stopped. Must be stopped !{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.23,1:10:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这一拳为姐姐报仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one's for my sister!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.52,1:10:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,Juni.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.19,1:10:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,哈罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hola.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.16,1:11:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,卡门 朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carmen? Juni?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.87,1:11:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 妈 - 妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mom ! - Mom ! Aah !{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.04,1:11:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我的怪脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my Fooglie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.83,1:11:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我画的那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The one I drew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.13,1:11:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,是爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.09,1:11:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你们终于来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.63,1:11:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他来干嘛？- 他来帮忙的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's he doing here? - He's OK. He's OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.93,1:11:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你们怎么来的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you get here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.06,1:11:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,妈 我常常跷课到处玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom,I've been skipping school,going places...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.40,1:11:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,到城里坐摩天轮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}taking ferry rides in the city...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.16,1:11:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's OK. It's OK. I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.70,1:11:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,回家再说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll talk about it when we get home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.20,1:11:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 跑到贝立斯… - 什么？去哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Running off to Belize. - What? You went where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.62,1:11:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你说的对 回家再说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right. Let's just talk about this when we get home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.00,1:11:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,no,no,no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.50,1:11:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,把心里话告诉我吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can tell me everything now,OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.17,1:11:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你是想离开家人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that where you want to be,free from your family?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.42,1:12:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,以前想 现在不想了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I used to. Not anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.01,1:12:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你把我爸变成怪脸？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You turned my dad into a Fooglie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.77,1:12:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,I didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.02,1:12:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,但我可以把他变回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I might be able to change him back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.00,1:12:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,各位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.17,1:12:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的军团 正要前来接受检阅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your army marches to meet us as we speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.25,1:12:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢你们的信心及耐心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your faith and your patience have meant more than you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.76,1:12:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我谨代表暗黑破坏王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I speak for Mr. Floop when I say that the value...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.84,1:12:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,祝福我们绵长的友谊…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we place on partnership is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.55,1:12:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,迷你安 我是暗黑破坏王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Minion! This is Floop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.56,1:12:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,立刻到研究室来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please report to the robotics lab at once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.47,1:12:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,机器人出了很大的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have huge,major,big-time problems with the robots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.93,1:12:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,暗黑破坏王不是不在吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you said Floop wasn't here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.65,1:12:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他是不在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.19,1:12:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,迷你安 出了大麻烦 大问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A problem,Mr. Minion,as in mucho grande problemo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.86,1:13:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我去看一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna just be a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.03,1:13:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,迷你安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Minion!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.49,1:13:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,暗黑破坏王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Floop?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.33,1:13:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.50,1:13:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,在你后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Behind you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.75,1:13:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为你在干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think you're doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.25,1:13:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该跟其他人一样排队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're supposed to be in line with the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.88,1:13:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么不去排队？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're supposed to be with the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.26,1:13:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别学我 - 别学我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stop that. - Stop that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.01,1:13:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别胡闹 - 别胡闹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stop that this instant! - Stop that this instant!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.35,1:13:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,立刻闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop that right now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.31,1:13:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不然呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.69,1:13:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,真聪明的孩子 老克兹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clever boy you've got there,Cortez. Very clever indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.82,1:13:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他遗传他妈妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. He gets that from his mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.95,1:13:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我把女儿还你 我们停战如何？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I offer some sort of truce in exchange for your daughter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.54,1:13:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你爱说笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spoken for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.08,1:13:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我没看见你 我没看见她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you are. Didn't see you. Didn't see her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.87,1:13:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,让你也尝一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am going to show you what happens...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.21,1:14:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,害我家人的下场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when you cross the line and involve family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.17,1:14:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,舒舒服服躺好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now let's get nice and comfortable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.26,1:14:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,太美了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.55,1:14:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Promising. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.77,1:14:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你不可以 - 对 那你自己来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You couldn't possibly. - No,but you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.56,1:14:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,按紧一点 英格丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let go,Ingrid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.65,1:14:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你们两个来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,you two,come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.99,1:14:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,白痴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fools.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.13,1:14:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,快来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.50,1:14:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不能让军团离开城堡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to keep the army from leaving the castle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.55,1:14:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,唯一办法是去控制室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our only chance is to get to the control room...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.80,1:14:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,看任务设定好了没\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and hope that their missions have not been programmed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.05,1:14:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,万一设定好了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what if they have?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.30,1:14:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那就谁也挡不住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then there's no one on earth who can stop them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.01,1:14:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一个个进去 - 走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- One at a time. - Go. Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.94,1:15:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,左边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Left,left,left,left!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.36,1:15:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,走那边 爸妈呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That way. Where's Mom and Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.49,1:15:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,被机器人抓了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your doppelgangers have them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.07,1:15:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,能从这关掉吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you shut them down from here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.78,1:15:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,太迟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.16,1:15:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的机器人都装了第三脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Third Brain is linked not only to them...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.45,1:15:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,但所有的机器人儿童\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but to all the robot children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.92,1:15:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不能移除吗？- 有五百个 怎么移除？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can't you remove it? - We can't take 500 brains out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.75,1:15:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那就重新设定 - 要好几周\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So don't. Just reprogram it. - That would take weeks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.59,1:15:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 只要改两个字 - 对了 二元转换\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just two words. - A binary switch. Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.05,1:15:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就会把"好"变成"坏"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So they would define right as wrong...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.55,1:15:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,"坏"变成"好" 走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And wrong as right. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.55,1:15:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,但没那么容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's not that simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.18,1:15:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,想办法 待会见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Figure it out. We'll be back for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.89,1:15:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,教他们变好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Teach them to be good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.40,1:15:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,请坐"倪"先生 会舒服点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have a seat,Mr. Lithp. You'll be more comfortable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.19,1:15:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我姓"李"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Lisp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.44,1:15:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,葛小姐 我要看见我的军团才会舒服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My army,Ms. Gradenko,is the only comfort I need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.03,1:15:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,马上就来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're on their way now,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.54,1:15:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,迷你安？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Minion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.71,1:16:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你头怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to your head?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.33,1:16:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 可以再变回来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,don't worry. I think it's reversible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.46,1:16:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,妈 爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom ! Dad !{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.89,1:16:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.97,1:16:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他们现在更强更聪明了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're stronger and smarter now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.31,1:16:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So are we.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.57,1:16:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,看吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.12,1:16:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,雪特…冰淇淋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,shi...take mushrooms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.78,1:17:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.41,1:17:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,老李 原来是你在主使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lisp. Should have known you were behind this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.29,1:17:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这位是迷你安吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I take it you are Minion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.41,1:17:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这位是葛小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ms. Gradenko...I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.50,1:17:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是我没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,it's me,all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.50,1:17:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你孩子给我的新造型\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I owe my new look to your children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.59,1:17:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,该给他们奖励金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remind me to raise their allowance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.63,1:17:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,现在该展示一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Minion,I think now would be a good time...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.72,1:17:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你们制造的超级小孩了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to see a demonstration of your wonderfully demonic children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.85,1:17:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Certainly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.87,1:18:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,制伏你爸妈真容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your parents were so easy to capture...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.20,1:18:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你也好不到哪去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you're not any better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.87,1:18:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,可怜的小朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor little Juni.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.66,1:18:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,虚弱 又没力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Defenseless and weak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.63,1:18:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,没用的小废物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a worthless little squirt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.97,1:18:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,别听她的 你不是废物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Juni! Don't listen to her. You're not worthless!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.10,1:18:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是你找到这个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You figured out how to get us here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.14,1:18:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你让破坏王知道他是好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You helped Floop realize he was good,not bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.60,1:18:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你让怪脸说出爸妈在地牢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You talked to the Fooglies and saved Mom and Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.15,1:18:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你很强 朱尼 你很强壮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're strong,Juni! You're strong!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.07,1:18:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,但没那么强壮啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not that strong,Juni!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.37,1:18:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,吃奶的小朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Puny...Juni.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.33,1:18:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.51,1:19:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,瞬间接著剂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Instant cement!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.81,1:19:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,应该可以撑一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That should hold them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.78,1:19:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快去找爸妈 - 好主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's go find Mom and Dad. - Good idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.20,1:19:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,所有机器人向大房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All robots report to the grand room...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.57,1:19:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,做最具破坏力的最后展示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for a final demonstration of your destructive powers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.29,1:19:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 妈 爸 - 朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mom,Dad ! - Juni!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.50,1:19:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,闭上眼 别看他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carmen,Juni,close your eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.50,1:19:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不想让你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't want you to see this,OK?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.64,1:19:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,有办法吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any ideas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.56,1:19:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我在想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm thinking. I'm thinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.15,1:19:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wonderful. Wonderful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.52,1:19:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 卡门？- 朱尼？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Carmen? - No. Juni?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.57,1:20:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是一家人 一家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've thought it out. Yes. I've thought it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.86,1:20:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我大概想到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.28,1:20:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,说啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.91,1:20:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,家人们 这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Family,here's what we do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.91,1:20:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我负责右边一百\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take the hundred on the right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.83,1:20:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你负责左边一百\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ingrid,you take the hundred on the left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.83,1:20:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,卡门 中间左边一百\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carmen,hundred center-left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.04,1:20:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,朱尼 中间右边一百\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Juni,center-right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.38,1:20:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,一定可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll work. It'll work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.76,1:20:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,爸 一共有五百个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's 500 total,Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.42,1:20:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还需要一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need one more person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.93,1:20:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 红贝 - 哈罗 小弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Isador. - Hello,little brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.36,1:20:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Children !{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.70,1:20:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,把他们骨头拆了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tear them limb from limb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.62,1:20:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么教他们？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. How? How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.66,1:20:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,让环境引导他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll have to teach them. Shaped by environment,man...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.33,1:20:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.22,1:21:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,迷你安 叫他们放开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Minion ! Tell them to put me down !{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.35,1:21:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他们有自己意志了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their mind is a mirror now,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.10,1:21:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们说的话他们左边进 右边出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything we tell them goes in one ear and out the other!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.03,1:21:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你干嘛回来？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you come back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.62,1:21:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我离开理由一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the same reason I left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.12,1:21:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.83,1:21:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我忘了那个理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't remember that reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.75,1:21:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neither do I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.88,1:21:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's OK,it's OK.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.88,1:21:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,没事 哭吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's OK. Let it go. Let it go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.93,1:21:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's fine. He's gonna be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.51,1:21:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他感情丰富 拉丁人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's emotional. Latinos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.43,1:21:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,没事了 好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK. That's it.That's it. That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.94,1:21:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你教他们什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So,what did you teach them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.44,1:22:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我没教他们什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not what I can teach the children...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.36,1:22:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,是你教了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but what you taught me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.24,1:22:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,今天你赢了 不是因为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won today,Juni,and not because...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.49,1:22:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你最强壮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you were the biggest or the strongest...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.49,1:22:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为你有纯真的心和想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but because you were pure of heart and of mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.20,1:22:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,机器人也学到了这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now the robots have learned that as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.71,1:22:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.00,1:22:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们如愿以偿再次出任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We went on the old-fashioned adventure I always wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.80,1:22:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,却没做对一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we didn't do one thing right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.30,1:22:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.30,1:22:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,至少我们做对"这两个"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We did two things right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.85,1:22:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉你们一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is something that we have to tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.35,1:22:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你爸爸和我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father and I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.52,1:22:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,是间谍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're secret agents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.48,1:22:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉你们一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have something to tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.40,1:22:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也是间谍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're secret agents,too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.87,1:23:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,世界各国陆续传出佳讯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eight more incidents witnessed today all in different countries...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.88,1:23:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,又一群小孩有惊人善举\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of yet another group of children who've done some incredible good deeds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.88,1:23:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这些神奇的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems that a day doesn't go by that another amazing child...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.72,1:23:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不断进行服务和慈善工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}performs some outstanding act of charity or community service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.68,1:23:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are these children...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.35,1:23:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么这么爱行善？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and why are they so good at being good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.27,1:23:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我要看财经版\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta have the business section.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.27,1:23:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是"退休"了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you closed down your shop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.23,1:23:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,还是要注意市场动态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,but I gotta keep tabs on free enterprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.36,1:23:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,两位 别再吵了行吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boys,can we please stop fighting?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.95,1:23:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,小朋友们 快来看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,kids,it's time for...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.33,1:23:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,暗黑破坏秀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Floop's Fooglies!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.88,1:23:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,早安 孩子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning,my children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.71,1:23:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,今天我要介绍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today,I'd like to introduce you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.71,1:23:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,两个新角色 到我们节目里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to two new characters on our show...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.05,1:23:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,卡门妮塔和朱尼多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carmenita and Junito.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.72,1:23:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,克兹先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah,Cortezes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.06,1:23:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,远东发生一件紧急任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An emergency assignment has come up in the Far East.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.56,1:23:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,需要立刻出动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you on it right away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.94,1:24:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 老戴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,sorry,Devlin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.40,1:24:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,还没跟家人商量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We haven't talked about this as a family yet,so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.86,1:24:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是否要退休\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whether we come out of retirement...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.19,1:24:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要和孩子们一起决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or not is a decision that is up to us and our kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.03,1:24:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,格瑞利 英格丽 不是找你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh,Gregorio,Ingrid,I wasn't talking to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.74,1:24:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这任务需要卡门和朱尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,this assignment is for Carmen and Juni.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.33,1:24:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're the ones we need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.66,1:24:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是有史以来最佳的干员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're the two most amazing field agents that this organization's ever seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.58,1:24:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子们 怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what do you say,kids?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.46,1:24:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,接受任务吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You up for it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.34,1:24:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,要克兹家人出马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Devlin,if you want the Cortezes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.88,1:24:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,就要全体出动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you take all the Cortezes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.18,1:24:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,爸妈也要去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even Mom and Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.30,1:24:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,从今以后我们一起行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From now on,whatever we do,we do together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.52,1:24:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,做间谍 很简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spy work...that's easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.60,1:24:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,一家人团结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keeping a family together...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.11,1:24:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,很难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's difficult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.28,1:24:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,是最值得努力的任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's the mission worth fighting for.{\r}
